# Plan 05-02 (D-14, D-17, A-11): the write-log channel (psg_log) and the not-requested rule. A NULL
# buffer with capacity 0 runs against a layout that needs bytes and equals the zero layout; a nonzero
# short capacity and a non-NULL buffer of capacity 0 are still refused; RUN_PSGLOG_NULL,
# RUN_PSGLOG_OVERLAP (instance, video, audio, events, top of the address space, the report) and
