# the whole run (C12, C77); halts: CPU_HALTED below the 20,000-tick cap; marker-last: tables and log final when
# the marker shows; slicing: one call versus 1 and 7 tick slices; nokey-timeout: no input leaves the guest in
# its poll loop at the target; order-equals-pass: the one-tick-apart split schedule gives the same result.
